Release v2.7
– New command \AddEnumextCounter to register counter styles that the package
  does not provide, such as \fnsymbol, for the label key.
– Tagged PDF: ordered lists now declare the numbering used in the label
  (Decimal, LowerAlpha, UpperAlpha, LowerRoman or UpperRoman).
– Tagged PDF: enumext* and keyans* without the counter in the label are now
  declared as unordered lists.
– The message of the save-ans key with the number of items and answers now
  starts with the name of the storage.
